WEBVTT

00:00:01.162 --> 00:00:02.297
Ooh, I know!

00:00:02.330 --> 00:00:03.965
You could gamble online!

00:00:03.999 --> 00:00:05.967
That's what Katie's dad does.

00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:08.904
Okay. We will definitely
look into that.

00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:10.906
That's a good suggestion.

00:00:10.939 --> 00:00:14.242
And let's not go over
to Katie's house anymore.

00:00:14.275 --> 00:00:17.245
-(phone ringing)
-Hmm?

00:00:17.278 --> 00:00:20.648
Ooh.

00:00:20.681 --> 00:00:22.350
-(laughing and cheering)
-GRU: Guys! Shh, shh, shh, shh.

00:00:22.383 --> 00:00:23.751
I don't think
you heard me right.

00:00:23.784 --> 00:00:25.820
No, no, no, no, no.
This does not mean

00:00:25.853 --> 00:00:27.923
that we are going back
to being villains.

00:00:27.956 --> 00:00:29.357
MINIONS:
Aw!

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.926
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:30.959 --> 00:00:32.928
Okay, all right.
I get it.

00:00:32.961 --> 00:00:35.730
Look, I know it's been
a little tough lately,

00:00:35.763 --> 00:00:37.865
especially with Dr. Nefario

00:00:37.899 --> 00:00:40.936
accidentally freezing himself
in carbonite.

00:00:40.969 --> 00:00:44.005
(grunts, groans)

00:00:44.039 --> 00:00:47.375
But our life of crime is over.

00:00:47.408 --> 00:00:49.377
Ah, w... Mel!

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:51.947
Mel, you're with me
on this, right?

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:53.881
Ah. (sputters,
speaks Minionese)

00:00:53.915 --> 00:00:55.883
-Bueno.
-MINIONS: Yay!

00:00:55.917 --> 00:00:57.552
-(Mel speaks Minionese)
-MINIONS: Boo!

00:00:57.585 --> 00:00:58.954
-MEL: Bueno.
-MINIONS: Yay!

00:00:58.987 --> 00:01:01.189
-(Mel speaking Minionese)
-MINIONS: Aah.

00:01:01.222 --> 00:01:03.058
-MEL: Bueno.
-MINIONS: Yay!

00:01:03.091 --> 00:01:06.227
-(Mel speaking Minionese)
-MINIONS: Boo!

00:01:06.261 --> 00:01:08.896
Minions...
(speaking Minionese)

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:11.266
(Mel chanting)

00:01:11.299 --> 00:01:13.969
Guys, listen to me!
Read my lips!

00:01:14.002 --> 00:01:16.104
Lisa me lippo.

00:01:16.137 --> 00:01:18.039
Pomodoro a comquit.
(speaking Minionese)

00:01:18.073 --> 00:01:20.208
(Minion blows a raspberry,
Minions laughing)

00:01:20.241 --> 00:01:22.310
What? What? Huh?

00:01:22.343 --> 00:01:24.379
What did I say?
It's not "comquit"?

00:01:24.412 --> 00:01:26.447
-(laughter continues)
-Ah, okay.

00:01:26.481 --> 00:01:28.649
Pomodoro a kumquat.

00:01:28.683 --> 00:01:31.819
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
(speaking Minionese)

00:01:31.852 --> 00:01:33.454
Don't take that tone with me.

00:01:33.488 --> 00:01:35.390
We're not going back
to villainy.

00:01:35.423 --> 00:01:36.958
Uh, no tyranny?

00:01:36.992 --> 00:01:39.727
Yes! And I don't want
to hear another word about it.

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:41.296
(blowing raspberry loudly)

00:01:41.329 --> 00:01:44.232
-(all blowing raspberries)
-GRU: Look,

00:01:44.265 --> 00:01:46.101
if you guys
don't stop right now,

00:01:46.134 --> 00:01:48.636
there will be consequences.

00:01:48.669 --> 00:01:50.905
Ah. (speaking Minionese)

00:01:50.938 --> 00:01:53.108
Hey, don't say anything
you're going to regret.

00:01:53.141 --> 00:01:55.943
Oh. (speaking Minionese) Hmm.

00:01:55.977 --> 00:01:57.678
Ciao. (speaking Minionese)

00:01:57.712 --> 00:01:59.347
-What? You quit?
-(Minions murmuring)

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:02.483
You're serious?
Come on!

00:02:02.517 --> 00:02:04.585
(grunting)

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:06.787
(laughter)

00:02:06.821 --> 00:02:09.257
-(speaking Minionese)
-GRU: Dave! Jerry!

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:10.691
(laughs)

00:02:10.725 --> 00:02:12.160
Great news, guys.

00:02:12.193 --> 00:02:14.029
You have been promoted.

00:02:14.062 --> 00:02:15.630
You're in charge now.

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:17.498
Huh? Not bad.

00:02:17.532 --> 00:02:19.334
(laughing and whooping)

00:02:19.367 --> 00:02:20.868
(speaking Minionese)

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.437
Yippee!

00:02:22.470 --> 00:02:24.305
Roo-ba, roo-ba, roo-ba,
roo-ba, roo-ba, roo-ba...

00:02:24.339 --> 00:02:25.706
(groans)

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.709
Jeesh!

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.022
(gasps)

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.228
(grunts)

00:02:47.262 --> 00:02:49.864
Ah, Monsieur Pompeux!
Mwah. Mwah.

00:02:49.897 --> 00:02:52.200
To what do we owe the presence

00:02:52.233 --> 00:02:55.636
of the world's
foremost gem expert?

00:02:55.670 --> 00:02:57.705
The chief of police sent me.

00:02:57.738 --> 00:03:00.741
He was concerned that during
the recent heist attempt,

00:03:00.775 --> 00:03:03.811
the Dumont diamond
was replaced with a phony.

00:03:03.844 --> 00:03:05.113
(others gasp)

00:03:13.088 --> 00:03:15.423
(mechanical chirping)

00:03:16.857 --> 00:03:19.127
(sniffing)

00:03:21.696 --> 00:03:23.064
Ooh-la-la!

00:03:23.098 --> 00:03:25.766
You have been duped.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:27.435
(gasps)
What? We have?!

00:03:27.468 --> 00:03:30.171
Yes. By me!

00:03:30.205 --> 00:03:31.572
(all gasping)

00:03:31.606 --> 00:03:33.341
(groans and gasps)

00:03:33.374 --> 00:03:34.842
(gasps)
But what is...?

00:03:34.875 --> 00:03:36.177
(muffled grunts)

00:03:36.211 --> 00:03:38.246
(groans, gasps)

00:03:38.279 --> 00:03:40.615
Oh, no! Help!

00:03:40.648 --> 00:03:42.283
(groaning)

00:03:45.086 --> 00:03:47.622
(laughing)

00:03:47.655 --> 00:03:50.057
("Take On Me" by A-ha playing)

00:03:55.263 --> 00:03:58.399
Ooh! (laughs)

00:03:58.433 --> 00:04:01.569
I've been a bad boy.

00:04:01.602 --> 00:04:03.070
Or should I say...

00:04:03.104 --> 00:04:05.806
(speaking French)

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.109
(laughing)

00:04:08.143 --> 00:04:09.644
-* Yeah
-* Yeah-uh *

00:04:09.677 --> 00:04:11.479
* There's something special

00:04:11.512 --> 00:04:13.981
* On the other side
of this moment *

00:04:14.014 --> 00:04:17.485
* Moment, moment, moment *

00:04:17.518 --> 00:04:19.920
-* Yeah, yeah-uh *
-* And it's about what

00:04:19.954 --> 00:04:23.057
-Oh.
-* You and I decide

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:25.626
-(snoring)
-* Decide, decide, decide *

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.495
* Yeah, yeah-uh *

00:04:27.528 --> 00:04:29.564
* And it's important for you
to remember *

00:04:29.597 --> 00:04:31.666
* We did this together

00:04:31.699 --> 00:04:34.335
-(snoring) -* Together,
together, together... *

00:04:34.369 --> 00:04:36.437
(wind chimes tinkle)

00:04:36.471 --> 00:04:38.806
(footsteps approaching)

00:04:43.844 --> 00:04:45.480
Hey, Gru.

00:04:45.513 --> 00:04:47.315
What you doing down here?

00:04:47.348 --> 00:04:48.583
In the dark.

00:04:48.616 --> 00:04:49.817
Alone.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.820
Oh, nothing.
Just thinking.

00:04:52.853 --> 00:04:54.322
You okay?

00:04:54.355 --> 00:04:57.192
Oh, yes.
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:04:57.225 --> 00:04:59.994
It's just...
Aah, I don't know.

00:05:00.027 --> 00:05:02.430
I guess I just feel like...

00:05:02.463 --> 00:05:04.699
a failure.

00:05:04.732 --> 00:05:07.368
Like I don't have
a purpose anymore.

00:05:07.402 --> 00:05:10.671
Hey, mister,
you are not a failure.

00:05:10.705 --> 00:05:14.141
If only
I could have nailed Bratt.

00:05:14.175 --> 00:05:17.445
So many times,
I almost had him.

00:05:17.478 --> 00:05:20.615
But now I'll never
get the chance...

00:05:20.648 --> 00:05:22.650
'cause I have been
kicked to the curb.

00:05:22.683 --> 00:05:24.385
Gru, you've got
to let this go.

00:05:24.419 --> 00:05:26.120
It's time to look forward.

00:05:26.153 --> 00:05:28.489
Things will get better,
I promise.

00:05:31.192 --> 00:05:33.828
Mwah.

